# L9b: Landscape Splines control points edited like UE (ULandscapeSplineControlPoint moved by the gizmo / deleted with
# Delete; the Splines edit layer is re-rasterized on every change; a sculpt on a layer BELOW re-applies the layer).
# Start: L9.scn's road - three points across the TerrainPlain hill at (6300|9282|12300, -1906), Width 400.
# The scenario SAVES nothing; still `git checkout -- Projects/Desert/Content/Scenes/G3_TwoTerrains*` after a play.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene G3_TwoTerrains.desce"
Дано run Landscape "Sculpt mode"
Дано run Landscape "Tool: Splines"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 6300,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 12300,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,5000,-8000
# Drag: select the middle point (camera straight down over it), then move it 800 cm sideways (+Z), one undo step.
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1906
Когда run Landscape "Spline: select control point at viewport centre"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1106
Когда run Landscape "Spline: move selected control point to viewport centre"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,5000,-8000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.55,0.84
Когда state
Тогда 0_drag the road bends through the moved middle point (800 cm further from the camera), the old straight band is gone
# Sculpt on the BASE layer (the editing layer; the Splines layer sits above it) right under the moved road.
Когда run Landscape "Tool: Sculpt"
Когда run Landscape "Brush radius: larger"
Когда run Landscape "Brush radius: larger"
Когда run Landscape "Brush radius: larger"
Когда run Landscape "Tool strength: larger"
Когда run Landscape "Tool strength: larger"
Когда run Landscape "Tool strength: larger"
Когда run Landscape "Tool strength: larger"
Когда run Landscape "Tool strength: larger"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1106
Когда run Landscape "Stroke at the viewport centre"
Когда run Landscape "Stroke at the viewport centre"
Когда run Landscape "Stroke at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,5000,-8000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.55,0.84
Когда state
Тогда 1_sculpt_below the ground beside the road is raised into a bump, the road band stays flat across it
# Delete the middle point (UE: Delete with the point selected): its two segments bridge the neighbours.
Когда run Landscape "Tool: Splines"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1106
Когда run Landscape "Spline: select control point at viewport centre"
Когда run Landscape "Spline: delete selected control point"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,5000,-8000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.55,0.84
Когда state
Тогда 2_delete a straight 2-point road from (6300,-1906) to (12300,-1906); the bend is gone, the bump shows again where it was flattened
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда state
Тогда 3_undo identical to 1_sculpt_below
